// List of flags for PIP-MON - see papyrus_flags.flg.md for the full rationale.
//
// The FO4 Papyrus compiler parses this file with an ANTLR grammar that accepts
// `//` comments and a `Flag <Name> <index> { <types> }` structure. A bare word
// per line is NOT valid, and `;` comments are NOT valid. The index is
// arbitrary; the type block scopes where the flag may appear. We declare the
// flags referenced by the base game sources under Data\Scripts\Source so that
// compiling our surface against them succeeds without needing Bethesda's
// unshipped Institute_Papyrus_Flags.flg.

Flag Hidden 0
